      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis beautifully presented four bedroom, three-bathroom home has been fully refurbished, finished and furnished to an 'as new' condition in Dun Lavin, W91W8X4\n\nThe property is in 'move-in-ready' condition. The bright and spacious accommodation includes a stylish fitted kitchen with breakfast bar and integrated appliances, a comfortable living room, three bedrooms, three bathrooms, a separate utility area and a private rear courtyard. Appliances include washing machine, dish washer, electric hob, oven, TV, fridge freezer, smoke detectors, alarm etc\n\nThe house also benefits from modern zone-controlled heating, allowing different areas of the home to be heated independently for greater comfort and efficiency.\n\nEverything this bustling town has to offer is right on your doorstep, with grocery and convenience stores, coffee shops, butcher, hardware store, schools, pubs, church, pharmacy and other everyday amenities located directly across the road. \n\nIt is ideally located at W91W8X4  approximately:\n\n- 10 minutes from Kilcullen\n- 18 minutes from Naas\n- 18 minutes to Blessington\n- 25 minutes from Carlow\n- 50 minutes from Dublin Centre\n\nA bus stop is available around the corner for easy commuting.\n\nThis exceptional property combines modern comfort with an unbeatable village-centre location. Homes of this quality rarely become available.\n\nKey features:\n- Four bedrooms\n- Three bathrooms\n- Fully refurbished to an excellent modern standard\n- Pristine condition throughout\n- Zone-controlled heating\n- Bright, contemporary kitchen and dining area\n- Breakfast bar and integrated appliances\n- Spacious living room with feature fireplace\n- Separate utility area\n- Private rear courtyard\n- All local amenities on the doorstep\n- Bus stop nearby\n- Excellent access to Kilcullen, Naas, Carlow and Dublin\n\nKindly present your working background, references etc."
      }
